  "ruleText": "Pda 514.10 Decision by Authority on Appeal. The authority shall render a decision regarding the appeal no later than the next regularly scheduled board meeting following any board meeting held under Pda 514.09.\n\nSource. #9641, eff 2-1-10; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
